  "prefLabel": "He-P 813.02 Scope",
  "priorExpiration": "2019-09-16",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 813.02 Scope. These rules shall apply to any individual, agency, partnership, association, or other legal entity offering adult family care services to one or 2 residents in a home-like environment and receiving reimbursement from the New Hampshire Medicaid choices for independence (CFI) waiver program for those services.\n\nSource. #8595, eff 4-1-06; ss by #9899-A, eff 3-29-11; ss by #12740, INTERIM, eff 3-20-19, EXPIRED: 9-16-19\n\nNew. #12934, eff 12-6-19",
